# Title: Office Macro File Creation
# ID: 91174a41-dc8f-401b-be89-7bfc140612a0
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-01-23
# Tags: attack.initial-access, attack.t1566.001
# Description: Detects the creation of a new office macro files on the systems
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((filemod_name:*.docm OR filemod_name:*.dotm OR filemod_name:*.xlsm OR filemod_name:*.xltm OR filemod_name:*.potm OR filemod_name:*.pptm)) AND -(((process_name:C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\* OR process_name:C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Office\\*) AND (process_name:*\\WINWORD.EXE OR process_name:*\\EXCEL.EXE OR process_name:*\\POWERPNT.EXE) AND filemod_name:*\\~$*)))
